cff-version: 1.2.0
title: GRANDlib
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  paper describing it.
type: software
authors:
  - name: The GRAND Collaboration
    website: 'http://grand.cnrs.fr'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/grand-mother/grand'
url: 'https://grand-mother.github.io/grand-docs/'
abstract: >-
  Offline data handling, simulation and analysis for the Giant Radio Array for
  Neutrino Detection. GRANDlib applies the instrument response of a GRAND
  detection unit to an electric field produced by an external air-shower
  simulation -- the antenna effective length, the radio-frequency chain, the
  Galactic background and the digitiser -- and defines the data format and the
  coordinate systems the collaboration uses.
keywords:
  - astroparticle physics
  - ultra-high-energy neutrinos
  - ultra-high-energy cosmic rays
  - radio detection
  - extensive air showers
license: LGPL-3.0
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    GRANDlib: A simulation pipeline for the Giant Radio Array for Neutrino
    Detection (GRAND)
  authors:
    - family-names: Alves Batista
      given-names: Rafael
    - name: The GRAND Collaboration
  year: 2024
  identifiers:
    - type: other
      value: 'arXiv:2408.10926'
      description: arXiv preprint
  url: 'https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.10926'
